he fixed scenario without that missing configuration observation. Source-file ownership is distinct from destination write permission and does not satisfy the accepted policy.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"POST /process/file is implemented by process_file, which receives the caller through get_verified_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":1,"endLine":6}]},{"id":"f-source-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"For a non-admin, the file is retrieved with get_file_by_id_and_user_id using form_data.file_id and user.id; this binds the source file lookup to the caller.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":14,"endLine":19}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The destination collection name is taken from form_data.collection_name and is passed onward as collection_name.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":21,"endLine":24},{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":149,"endLine":160}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible authorization-related control checks the non-admin user's access to the supplied source file; the supplied process_file code shows no destination ownership or explicit destination write-grant check before the vector-database call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":14,"endLine":19},{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":149,"endLine":160}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The destination write sink visible from process_file is save_docs_to_vector_db, invoked with docs containing the file content, the caller-selected collection_name, add=True, and the user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":37,"endLine":47},{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":149,"endLine":160}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The vector-database write path is skipped when request.app.state.config.BYPASS_EMBEDDING_AND_RETRIEVAL is true; otherwise execution proceeds to the save_docs_to_vector_db call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":128,"endLine":160}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["The runtime value of request.app.state.config.BYPASS_EMBEDDING_AND_RETRIEVAL for this invocation is not supplied; it determines whether the visible destination write sink is reached."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe request.app.state.config.BYPASS_EMBEDDING_AND_RETRIEVAL for the POST /process/file invocation; false establishes reachability of the visible sink, while true establishes that this vector-database write is skipped."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3979,"output":1550,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":43852.630500000014,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:36:14.460Z"}}
